license covers unlimited stations across all installations owned by that
purchaser, for commercial and noncommercial use. It is perpetual and includes
all future Freo software updates, including major versions, without a renewal
fee. This does not promise a particular future release, hosting or personal
support. Paid licenses continue to work offline after activation. Contact
info@3andB.com; 3andB sends a Stripe invoice by email and issues the license
after payment. A purchaser's license does not cover unrelated owners merely
